Do no use bare except:
except: catches BaseException, which includes KeyboardInterrupt,
which means that ^C doesn't work.

fix typo in qtconsole history_next
while condition was always checking initial value,
rather than the iterating value.

ensure a fallback exists, so use local std{in,out,err}
Since IOStream instances require a valid fallback stream, use the locally defined std{in,out,err}
instead of sys.std{in,out,err} in IOTerm's __init__ method.  Note that the local std{in,out,err}
are IOStream instances as well, that fall back to os.devnull

fix isalive -> is_alive typo in external.ssh
only affected paramiko ssh tunnel cleanup in atexit.
from upstream changes in pyzmq (see pyzmq PR#157)
